Mufahras bundles data from the following sources. The app is not affiliated with or endorsed by any of them.

Quran text (Uthmani and IndoPak scripts): Tanzil Project, https://tanzil.net. The text is shown verbatim.
Translation: Saheeh International, © Dar Abul-Qasim.
Tafsir: "Abridged Explanation of the Quran" (Al-Mukhtasar fi Tafsir al-Quran), Tafsir Center for Quranic Studies.
Word-by-word English meanings, transliteration, topics, ayah themes, similar ayahs, mutashabihat and surah metadata: Quranic Universal Library (QUL), https://qul.tarteel.ai.
The 99 Names of Allah (Arabic, transliteration, English names and meanings): UmmahAPI, https://ummahapi.com/asma-ul-husna-api (provided as sadaqah jariah).
Hadith (Sahih al-Bukhari, Sahih Muslim, Sunan Abu Dawud, Jami at-Tirmidhi, Sunan an-Nasa'i, Sunan Ibn Majah), English and Arabic text and gradings: fawazahmed0/hadith-api, https://github.com/fawazahmed0/hadith-api (Unlicense).
Search-by-meaning model: snowflake-arctic-embed-s by Snowflake, https://huggingface.co/Snowflake/snowflake-arctic-embed-s (Apache License 2.0), served unmodified in its 8-bit ONNX form. The vectors in data-src/vectors/ were computed with it from the texts above.

Search by meaning also uses ONNX Runtime Web by Microsoft (MIT License) and Tokenizers.js by Hugging Face (Apache License 2.0), included in the app's code.
